1. Abakozi babifitiye ububasha bo kugenza no gukurikirana ibyaha byerekeye amategeko y'inzira nyabagendwa n'uburyo bwo kuyigendamo ni:
a) Abapolisi ba Polisi y'Igihugu;
b) Abapolisi bo mu mutwe ushinzwe umutekano mu muhanda;
c) Abakozi ba gasutamo n'abandi bategetsi babiherewe ububasha bwihariye na Minisitiri ushinzwe ubutabera.
2. Abo bakozi bagomba kugaragaza ibimenyetso biranga umurimo wabo mu gihe bari mu kazi, nko kwambara impuzankano y'akazi, ikirango kibaranga, cyangwa ikarita y'akazi mu gihe bambaye gisivili.

1. Umuyobozi wese w'ikinyabiziga cyangwa inyamaswa ugize uruhare mu mpanuka ibereye mu nzira nyabagendwa agomba:
a) Guhita ahagarara ako kanya aho bishoboka bitabangamiye imigendere y'abandi;
b) Gutanga ubutabazi bushoboka ku bakomeretse no guhamagara abaganga n'inzego z'umutekano;
c) Gushyiraho ibimenyetso by'impanuka (icyapa kiburira cya mpandeshatu mu ntera itari munsi ya metero 30 ahatari mu nsisiro cyangwa metero 100 ahantu habi nko mu makorosi);
d) Kutagira icyo ahindura ku miterere y'aho impanuka yabereye igihe hari abapfuye cyangwa abakomeretse bikabije, keretse igihe bibaye ngombwa mu gutabara indembe cyangwa kugarura urujya n'uruza;
e) Kwerekana ibyangombwa bye n'iby'ikinyabiziga igihe abisabwe n'umukozi ubifitiye ububasha cyangwa undi wagize igihombo mu mpanuka;
f) Kumenyesha inzego za polisi impanuka mu gihe kitarenze amasaha 24 igihe abakozi babishinzwe batageze aho yabereye.

1. Abagendera mu nzira nyabagendwa bose bagomba kubahiriza amategeko n'amabwiriza bahabwa n'abakozi babifitiye ububasha.
2. Ibimenyetso by'abakozi babifitiye ububasha birusha agaciro amategeko yose agenga uburyo bwo kugendera mu muhanda, ibyapa, amatara n'ibimenyetso byo mu muhanda.
3. Ibimenyetso bikoreshwa n'abakozi babifitiye ububasha bikorwa bityo:
a) Ukuboko kuzamuye hejuru: Gutegeka guhagarara abagenzi bose, keretse abageze mu masangano hagati batagishoboye guhagarara mu buryo butamuteza ibyago;
b) Ukuboko cyangwa amaboko arambuye mu buryo butambitse: Gutegeka guhagarara abagenzi baturuka mu byerekezo bisanganya ibyerekanwa n'amaboko arambuye;
c) Kuzunguza intambike itara ritukura nijoro: Gutegeka guhagarara abo iryo tara riganishaho;
d) Gukoresha ifirimbi:
- Ifirimbi imwe ndende: Kwitegura guhagarara;
- Utufirimbi tubiri tugufi: Gutambuka;
- Utufirimbi twinshi tugufi: Gutegeka kugabanya umuvuduko cyangwa guhagarara byihuse.

1. Nta muntu ushobora gutwara ikinyabiziga kigendeshwa na moteri mu nzira nyabagendwa adafite uruhushya rwo gutwara ikinyabiziga rwatanzwe n'ubutegetsi bubifitiye ububasha.
2. Inzego (categories) z'uruhushya rwo gutwara ibinyabiziga zigabanyijwemo:
a) Urwego A: Amapikipiki n'ibinyamitende bifite moteri;
b) Urwego B: Imodoka zagenewe gutwara abantu zifite intebe zitarenze umunani uretse iy'umuyobozi, n'imodoka zitwara imizigo itarengeje uburemere ntarengwa bwemewe bwa toni 3.5;
c) Urwego C: Imodoka zagenewe gutwara imizigo irengeje uburemere bwa toni 3.5;
d) Urwego D: Imodoka zagenewe gutwara abantu zifite intebe zirenze umunani uretse iy'umuyobozi;
e) Urwego E: Ibinyabiziga bikurura romoruki irengeje uburemere bwa kg 750 zigenewe inzego B, C, cyangwa D;
f) Urwego F: Ibinyabiziga by'abamugaye byahinduwe ku buryo bwihariye.
3. Uruhushya rw'agateganyo (Permis provisoire):
- Rumara igihe cy'amezi atatu (3);
- Rushobora kongerwa inshuro zitarenze eshatu (3);
- Umunyeshuri agomba kugendana n'umwigisha wujuje ibyangombwa;
- Ikinyabiziga kigomba gushyirwaho inyuma icyapa cy'inyuguti ya 'L' y'umweru mu buso bw'ubururu, bufite uburebure butari munsi ya santimetero 15, cyangwa icyapa cyanditseho 'AUTO-ECOLE' mu nyuguti z'umukara.
4. Ibisabwa by'ubuzima (Amaso):
- 8/10 ku maso yombi, cyangwa 7/10 n'ijisho rimwe na 9/10 ku rindi, cyangwa 6/10 n'ijisho rimwe na 10/10 ku rindi;
- Gutsinda ikizamini cyo kutandukanya amabara (daltonisme).
5. Icyemezo cy'agateganyo (Attestation) gitangwa mu minsi 15 igihe uruhushya rwatakaye cyangwa rwangiritse.

1. Mu masangano y'imihanda yose, umuyobozi wese agomba guha inzira ikinyabiziga giturutse mu ruhande rw'iburyo bwe, keretse iyo amategeko cyangwa ibyapa biteganya ukundi.
2. Itegeko ryo gutambuka mbere kw'iburyo ntirikurikizwa:
a) Ku kinyabiziga kiva mu nzira y'ubutaka cyangwa akayira k'amatungo cyinjira mu muhanda wa kaburimbo;
b) Ku kinyabiziga kiva mu kibanza cyiteganye, parikingi cyangwa garage kwinjira mu muhanda nyabagendwa;
c) Imbere y'ibinyabiziga ndakumirwa biranga icyo bishinzwe binyuze ku matara y'ubururu n'inzogera zidasanzwe;
d) Ahari ibyapa bigenga gutambuka mbere (B.1, B.2a Stop, B.3, B.4).

1. Umuyobozi wese ushaka guhindura icyerekezo, gukata iburyo cyangwa ibumoso, agomba:
a) Kubanza kureba mu ndorerwamo no kwiringira ko abikora nta nkomyi;
b) Gutanga ikimenyetso cy'indangacyerekezo (clignotant) cyangwa ukuboko mu ntera itari munsi ya metero 50 mbere yo gukata;
c) Kwiyegereza inkombe y'iburyo niba akatira iburyo, cyangwa umurongo ugabanya umuhanda mo kabiri niba akatira ibumoso mu muhanda ugenderwamo mu byerekezo byombi;
d) Guha inzira abanyamaguru bambukiranya umuhanda agiye kwinjiramo.

1. Kunyuranaho bikorerwa mu ruhande rw'ibumoso.
2. Kunyuranaho bishobora gukorerwa iburyo gusa igihe umuyobozi uri imbere yagaragaje ko agiye gukatira ibumoso kandi yashyize ikinyabiziga cye hagati mu muhanda.
3. Mbere yo kunyuranaho, umuyobozi agomba:
a) Kureba neza ko nta kinyabiziga kimuri inyuma cyatangiye kumunyuraho;
b) Kwiringira ko umuhanda ugaragara neza imbere mu ntera nibura ya metero 100;
c) Kurusha umuvuduko uwo agiye kunyuraho nibura kilometero 20 mu isaha (20 km/h);
d) Gusiga intera y'impande (clearance latérale) idashobora kuba munsi ya:
- Santimetero 50 (50 cm) ku kindi kinyabiziga kigendeshwa na moteri;
- Metero imwe (1 m) ku munyamaguru, ku igare, cyangwa ku nyamaswa.

Birabujijwe kunyuranaho:
1. Hafe y'isonga y'umusozi (sommet de côte) no mu makorosi aho ubugari bw'umuhanda n'uburebere bitaboneka neza;
2. Hafe cyangwa mu masangano y'inzira nyabagendwa n'inzira ya gariyamoshi;
3. Mu masangano y'imihanda iyo ugomba guha inzira abaturutse iburyo;
4. Ahari umurongo wera udacagaguye (ligne continue);
5. Ku myanya yagenewe abanyamaguru (passages pour piétons);
6. Igihe cyose ikirere kimeze nabi nko mu gihu cyinshi, mu mvura nyinshi cyangwa mu mucucu w'umwijima utuma udashobora kureba neza imbere muri metero 100.

1. Umuyobozi wese agomba gucunga umuvuduko w'ikinyabiziga cye hakurikijwe:
a) Imiterere y'inzira nyabagendwa;
b) Imiterere n'uburemere bw'ibyo atwaye;
c) Imiterere y'ikirere n'uko urumuri rumeze;
d) Ubwinshi bw'abagendera mu muhanda.
2. Umuyobozi agomba kugabanya umuvuduko we cyane cyane ahantu habi nko mu makorosi, mu masangano, ahari amashuri, amavuriro, amasoko, n'igihe anyuze iruhande rw'abanyamaguru cyangwa inyamaswa.

Ahatari mu nsisiro, umuvuduko ntarengwa w'ibinyabiziga uteye ku buryo bukurikira:
1. Kilometero mirongo inani mu isaha (80 km/h):
- Ku mapikipiki n'imodoka zagenewe gutwara abantu zitarengeje uburemere bwa toni 3.5 zidakora umwuga wo gutwara abantu mu buryo rusange;
2. Kilometero mirongo irindwi mu isaha (70 km/h):
- Ku modoka zitwara abantu mu buryo rusange (taxis n'izindi) zitarengeje uburemere bwa toni 3.5;
3. Kilometero mirongo itandatu mu isaha (60 km/h):
- Ku binyabiziga bifite uburemere buri hagati ya toni 3.5 na toni 12.5;
- Kuri za bisi zagenewe gutwara abantu;
4. Kilometero mirongo itanu mu isaha (50 km/h):
- Ku binyabiziga bifite uburemere burenze toni 12.5;
- Kuri velomoteri;
5. Kilometero makumyabiri n'itanu mu isaha (25 km/h):
- Ku bikoresho by'ubuhinzi n'ibinyabiziga bidasanzwe bidafite ibiziga by'imipira ihagwa.

Ingingo zerekeye umuvuduko ntarengwa ntizikurikizwa:
1. Ku binyabiziga ndakumirwa (polisi, imbangukiragutabara, ibizimya inkongi) igihe bitabaye byihutirwa kandi bigaragazwa n'inzogera idasanzwe n'itara ry'ubururu rimyatsa;
2. Mu marushanwa y'umuvuduko yemerewe ku buryo bwemewe n'amategeko mu nzira zafunzwe ku buryo bwihariye.

Birabujijwe guhagarara akanya gato cyangwa umwanya munini ahantu hakurikira:
1. Ku tuyira tw'abanyamaguru no ku ntera iri munsi ya metero eshanu (5 m) mbere y'aho banyura;
2. Ku nzira z'amagare;
3. Mu masangano y'imihanda no mu ntera iri munsi ya metero eshanu (5 m) uvuye ku masangano;
4. Mu makorosi no mu ntera iri munsi ya metero 20 uvuye mu ikorosi ahatari mu nsisiro;
5. Hafe y'isonga y'umusozi (sommet de côte);
6. Ku mateme, munsi y'amateme cyangwa mu mihanda y'ikuzimu (tunnels);
7. Hateganye n'umurongo wera ukomeje iyo umwanya usigaye uri munsi ya metero 3;
8. Imbere y'ibyapa byo ku muhanda cyangwa ibimenyetso bimurika ku buryo wabikingiriza abandi bagenzi;
9. Ku mikorere y'inzira ya gariyamoshi no mu ntera iri munsi ya metero 20;
10. Aho icyapa C.19 kibibuza.

Birabujijwe guhagarara umwanya munini ahantu hakurikira:
1. Imbere y'imiryango y'amazu cyangwa ibipangu byinjirwamo n'ibinyabiziga;
2. Ahagenewe guhagararamo ibinyabiziga bitwara abantu muri rusange (bus stops, E.9);
3. Ahari umugongo w'umuhondo ucagaguye uciye ku nkombe y'umuhanda;
4. Imbere y'amashuri, amasoko n'ahantu hahurira abantu benshi;
5. Aho icyapa C.18 kibibuza.

1. Ibinyabiziga ndakumirwa (véhicules prioritaires) ni:
a) Ibinyabiziga bya Polisi y'Igihugu n'iby'ingabo z'Igihugu biri mu butumwa bw'akazi;
b) Ibinyabiziga byo kuzimya inkongi y'umuriro;
c) Ibinyabiziga by'ubutabazi n'imbangukiragutabara (ambulances) zitwaye indembe.
2. Ibyo binyabiziga birangwa no gucana itara ry'ubururu rimyatsa ribonwa mu mpande zose n'inzogera idasanzwe y'amajwi abiri (sirène à deux tons).

Ibinyabiziga bigendeshwa na moteri bigomba kugira:
1. Imbere: Amatara abiri maremare y'urumuri rwera cyangwa rw'umuhondo, n'amatara abiri magufi;
2. Inyuma: Amatara abiri atukura ndanga-nyuma, amatara abiri yo guhagarara (feux stop) atukura, n'itara ryera ribonesha icyapa kiranga nimero;
3. Amatara ndanga-cyerekezo (clignotants) abiri imbere n'abiri inyuma.

1. Amatara maremare agomba kuzimywa hagasimburwa n'amatara magufi ahantu hakurikira:
a) Iyo umuhanda umurikiwe neza ku buryo umuyobozi abona nibura muri metero 100 imbere ye;
b) Igihe kigiye kubisikana n'ikindi kinyabiziga, mu ntera itari munsi ya metero 100;
c) Igihe gikurikiye ikindi kinyabiziga mu ntera iri munsi ya metero 50;
d) Mu nsisiro aho umuhanda umurikiwe.
2. Amapikipiki na velomoteri bigomba guhora byatsa amatara magufi igihe cyose biri mu nzira nyabagendwa, haba ku manywa cyangwa nijoro.

1. Ihoni rikoreshwa gusa kugira ngo birinde impanuka cyangwa haburirwe umugenzi ugiye kunyurwaho ahatari mu nsisiro.
2. Birabujijwe kuvuza ihoni:
a) Hagati ya saa yine z'ijoro (10 PM) na mu gitondo hakoreshwa imburira zimurika;
b) Mu nsisiro uretse mu gihe cyo gukumira impanuka itunguranye;
c) Hafe y'ibitaro, amavuriro n'amashuri;
d) Aho icyapa kibibuza (C.17).

1. Umuyobozi wese w'imodoka yagenewe gutwara abantu n'umugenzi wicaye ku ntebe y'imbere bagomba kuzirika umukandara wo kwirinda ibyago (ceinture de sécurité) igihe ikinyabiziga kigenda.
2. Basonewe kwizirika umukandara:
a) Abantu bafite icyemezo cya muganga kibibangira kubera impamvu z'uburwayi bukomeye cyangwa abagore batwite;
b) Abayobozi b'imodoka zitwara abagenzi mu buryo rusange bakora ingendo ngufi zihagarara kenshi;
c) Abakozi b'iposita n'abandi bakora ibikorwa bituma binjira kandi basohoka kenshi mu kinyabiziga.

1. Abayobozi b'amagare na velomoteri bagomba kugendera mu ruhande rw'iburyo, ku murongo umwe.
2. Birabujijwe:
a) Kugenda badakandagiye ku birenge by'igare cyangwa barekuye amahembe;
b) Gukururwa n'ikindi kinyabiziga;
c) Gutwara abantu ku buryo butemewe cyangwa imizigo ibangamiye ubuyobozi bw'ikinyamitende;
d) Kurenza umuvuduko wa km 40 mu isaha;
e) Kugendera hagati y'imirongo ibiri y'imodoka.

1. Amatungo n'inyamaswa biyoborwa mu nzira nyabagendwa bigomba kugira abayobozi bahagije kugira ngo batabangamira urujya n'uruza.
2. Umukumbi w'amatungo maremare arenze ane (4) cyangwa amatungo magufi arenze atandatu (6) ugomba kugabanywamo amatsinda:
- Buri tsinda rigizwe n'inyamaswa zitarenze umunani (8);
- Hagati y'itsinda n'irindi hagomba gusigara metero makumyabiri (20 m);
- Inyamaswa zikurura ibinyabiziga ntizigomba kurenza 12, ntizirenze 4 zishoreranye n'eshatu zibangikanye.

1. Ku mihanda y'imodoka (autoroutes) yagenewe ibinyabiziga byihuta birabujijwe:
a) Kugendwamo n'abanyamaguru, amagare, velomoteri, ibinyabiziga bikururwa n'inyamaswa n'amatungo;
b) Guhagarara akanya gato cyangwa umwanya munini uretse mu myanya yabigenewe;
c) Guhindukira (faire demi-tour) cyangwa gusubira inyuma;
d) Kwinjira mu gice kigabanya imihanda mo kabiri.
2. Umuvuduko ntarengwa wemewe ni km 100 mu isaha, naho umuvuduko muto ntarengwa (vitesse minimale) ni km 50 mu isaha ku gisate cy'ibumoso.

1. Imizigo ikinyabiziga cyikoreye igomba gupakirwa no gupangwa ku buryo idashobora:
a) Guteza abantu ibyago mu rugendo;
b) Kwangiza mu rugendo inzira nyabagendwa, impande zayo, ibiyubatseho cyangwa umutungo uyikikije;
c) Kubuza umuyobozi kubona neza cyangwa kubangamira gufata ku muhanda cyangwa imiyoborere y’ikinyabiziga;
d) Gukingiriza amatara, uturebanyuma two hanze, ibimenyetso byerekana icyerekezo, utugarura-rumuri, nimero ziranga ikinyabiziga cyangwa ibimenyetso umuyobozi yerekanisha ukuboko.
Imizigo igomba gupakirwa kandi iyo ari ngombwa ikazirikwa ku modoka ku buryo idashobora kugwa no gukururuka mu nzira nyabagendwa no kugwisha ikinyabiziga.
Ibintu byose byifashisha nk’iminyururu, amahema, n’ibindi bigenewe kuzirika imizigo cyangwa kuyirinda kwangirika, bigomba kuyizenguruka ku buryo budanangiye.
2. Umuyobozi w’ikinyabiziga agomba gukora uko ashoboye kugirango imizigo itagenda ibomborana ku buryo bukabije.

1. A) Mu mijyi kimwe no mu mihanda y’igihugu igenwa na Minisitiri ushinzwe gutwara abantu n’ibintu uburemere ntarengwa ku kinyabiziga cyangwa ku binyabiziga bikururana bushyizweho ku buryo bukurikira:
Ubwikorezi ntarengwa bwemewe kuri buri mutambiko ufungwaho ibiziga bine buzaba:
- Kuri buri mutambiko usanzwe: toni 10 (10 T);
- Ku mitambiko ibiri ikurikiranye (tandem): toni 16 (16 T);
- Ku mitambiko itatu (tridem): toni 24 (24 T);
Ikamyo iyo ari yo yose ntishobora na rimwe gutwara ibintu birense toni 53 (53 T).

B) Ku yindi mihanda yagenwe na Minisitiri ushinzwe gutwara abantu n’ibintu, uburemere ntarengwa bwemewe kuri buri kinyabiziga cyangwa ku binyabiziga bikururana bishyizweho ku buryo bukurikira:
a) Ibinyabiziga bifite imitambiko 2 hariho makuzungu: Toni 12 (12 T);
b) Ibinyabiziga bifite imitambiko itatu cyangwa irenga hatariho makuzungu: Toni 16 (16 T);
c) Ibinyabiziga bifatanye:
- Bifite imitambiko itatu: Toni 12 (12 T);
- Bifite imitambiko ine cyangwa irenga: Toni 16 (16 T);
- Ibinyabiziga bikururana: Toni 20 (20 T).

C) Mu mijyi kimwe no mu mihanda yavuzwe mu migemo A na B, y’iki gika, uburemere ntarengwa bwemewe kuri buri ruziga bushyizweho ku buryo bukurikira:
- Inziga zihagwa: Toni 3,20 ariko ingufu z’umwuka ntizirenga kg 5,5 kuri cm²;
- Inziga zifite umwuka ariko zidahagwa: Toni 15 DL;
- Inziga zidahagwa, izikoze mu byuma cyangwa izikoze muri kawucu gusa: Toni 8 DL ariko buri ruziga rukoze mu cyuma rudahagwa ntirurenga kg 250.
Mu ndemeko zavuzwe haruguru D ivuga muri metero, umurambararo w’inyuma y’umupira bapimiye mu butambike; naho L ikavuga ubugari busumba ubundi bwose bupimiwe mu murongo w’uruziga.

D) Uburemere ntarengwa kuri buri mutambiko bushyizweho ku buryo bukurikira:
a) Mu mijyi kimwe no mu mihanda ivugwa ku mugemo A w’iki gika: Toni 10 ariko umutambiko urushije iyindi kuremererwa mu mitambiko ikurikiranye ntube warenza toni 8;
b) Ku mihanda ivugwa ku mugemo B: Toni 5,5 ariko umutambiko urushije iyindi kuremererwa mu mitambiko ikurikiranye ntube warenza toni 4.
Ubwo buremere bugizwe n’igiteranyo cy’ubwikorezi bwose inziga zose zitsindagira ku butaka ishingiro ryabwo rikaba hagati y’ubuhagarike n’ubugari bukwirakwijwe mu bugari bwose bw’ikinyabiziga.
c) Ku yindi mihanda uretse iyavuzwe ku migemo A na B, y’iki gika, uburemere ntarengwa bwemewe bw’ikinyabiziga cyangwa ubw’ibinyabiziga bikururana ntibushobora kurenza toni 7 kandi buri mutambiko ntushobora kurenza toni 3,5.
d) Uretse bibonewe uruhushya ubundi birabujijwe gushyira no gukomeza kugendesha imodoka cyangwa romoruki mu nzira nyabagendwa yikoreye toni zirenga 5 ubariye kuri buri ntera ya metero imwe iri hagati y’imitambiko ibiri ihera cyangwa iyo uburemere bw’ibyikorewe burenze uburemere ntarengwa bwemewe n’ikarita iranga ikinyabiziga.

2. Ibivugwa mu gika cya mbere ntibikurikizwa iyo ari imashini zikoreshwa mu kubaka imihanda.
3. Ku byerekeye ibinyabiziga bigendeshwa n’ingufu za gazi n’ibigendeshwa n’ibyuma bibika amashanyarazi, uburebure bwavuzwe haruguru bwongerwaho hatarengejwe toni imwe, uburemere bw’ibyuma, uburemere bwa gazi, mu gihe ikinyabiziga kigenda, ibyuma bitwara iyo gazi cyangwa ibibitse amashanyarazi n’ibindi bijyana n’ibyo bikoresho.
4. Uburemere ntarengwa bw’ikinyabiziga n’ubwikorezi ntarengwa ku mitambiko itsindagiye ku butaka ntibishobora kurenga uburemere ikinyabiziga n’imitambiko yacyo byemerewe.
5. Minisitiri ushinzwe gutwara abantu n’ibintu ashobora:
a) Gutanga uruhusa, ku bice bimwe avuze by’inzira nyabagendwa kugirango binyurwemo kuburyo busanzwe n’ibinyabiziga bifite uburebure burenze ubwavuzwe haruguru;
c) Gutanga uruhusha akoresheje ibyemezo byihariye kandi by’igihe gito kugirango ibyo binyabiziga binyure mu mayira agenwe. Iyo bibaye ngombwa, ateganya ibigomba kuzuzwa kugirango ibyo binyabiziga bishobore kunyura muri ayo mayira.

1. Ikinyabiziga kigendeshwa na moteri n’ikinyabiziga gikururwa n’inyamaswa ntibishobora gukurura ibinyabiziga birenze bibiri (2).
Nyamara ipikipiki ifite akanyabiziga ku ruhande ntishobora gukurura romoruki n’imwe.

2. Gushyira mu muhanda ku buryo budasanzwe ibinyabiziga bikururana birenze bitatu bigomba gutangirwa uruhusa na Minisitiri ushinzwe gutwara abantu n’ibintu.

3. Ibivugwa mu gika cya 1 n’icya 2 by’iyi ngingo ntibikurikizwa ku binyabiziga bikururana bivugwa hepfo, bipfa kuba bigenda bitarengeje umuvuduko wakilometero 20 ku isaha (20 km/h):
a) Ibinyabiziga bikururana bikoreshwa mw’imurika-gurishwa cyangwa na ba mukerarugendo iyo bivuye aho bibikwa bigiye gukora cyangwa se iyo byimutse aho byakoreraga bijya gukora ahandi;
b) Ibinyabiziga bikururana bikoreshwa n’abapataniye imirimo iyo bivuye aho bibikwa bigiye aho bikora cyangwa iyo bitahutse cyangwa se iyo byimutse aho byakoraga bijya gukora ahandi;
c) Imashini zihinga zikururana iyo zigenda urugendo rutarenze kilometero 25 rwaho zikora;
d) Ibinyabiziga bikururana bitwaye ibyamamazwa.
Igiteranyo cy’uburebure bw’ibyo binyabiziga bikururana nti bishobora kurenga metero 25 (25 m).

1. Ibyapa byo ku mihanda bigizwe:
A) N’ibyapa biburira, ibyo gutambuka mbere;
B) Ibimenyetso bibuza cyangwa bitegeka;
C) N’ibyapa ndanga.
2. Ibyapa byo ku mihanda bigomba gushingwa ku ruhande rw’iburyo bw’umuhanda ku buryo umusozo wo hasi udashobora kuba munsi ya metero 1 na santimetero 50 (1.50 m) cyangwa hejuru ya metero 2 na santimetero 10 (2.10 m) uhereye ku butaka uretse ibyapa by’agateganyo.
3. Igisobanuro cy’icyapa gishobora kuzuzwa, gusiganurwa cyangwa kugenwa n’ibyapa by’inyongera bigizwe n’ibyapa by’urukiramende bifite ibigereranyo cyangwa inyandiko by’ibara ryirabura kiri ku buso bwera buzengurutswe n’umurongo wirabura cyangwa wera ku buso bw’ubururu kandi bigashyirwa munsi y’icyapa kibyegereye.

17. Ibimenyetso byerekana imirimo mu nzira nyabagendwa bishyirwaho n’uyikora.
Iyo hagomba gukoreshwa ibyapa byerekeye gutambuka mbere, ibyapa bibuza, ibyapa bitegeka, ibyapa byerekeye guhagarara akanya gato n’akarekare cyangwa ibimenyetso birombereje by’agateganyo byerekana ibisate by’umuhanda, ibyo bimenyetso ntibishobora gushyirwaho nta ruhushya rwa Perefe cyangwa intumwa ye. Urwo ruhushya rusobanura buri gihe ibimenyetso bizakoreshwa. Ibimenyetso byo mu muhanda bigomba kuvanwaho n’ukora imirimo ikimara kurangira.
2. Ibimenyetso by’inkomyi bishyirwaho:
- N’ubutegetsi bushinzwe inzira nyabagendwa, iyo ari inkomyi idaturutse ku muntu;
- N’uwateye iyo nkomyi;
Iyo uwateye iyo nkomyi atabikoze, bigomba gukorwa n’umutegetsi ushinzwe iby’umuhanda, amafaranga yakoreshejwe muri iyo mirimo ashobora kwishyuzwa uwananiwe kuyikoresha.

1. Hashyizweho « ibitabo bitandatu » by’amashakiro byanditsemo nomero zikurikiranye z’ibinyabiziga Bigendeshwa na moteri kimwe n’iza romoruki n’iza makuzungu, uretse iza romoruki ntoya:
1) Igitabo cy’amashakiro y’ibinyabiziga by’abikorera ku giti cyabo;
2) Igitabo cy’amashakiro y’ibinyabiziga bya za ambasade n’iby’imiryango ifite ubusonerwe nk’ubwa ambasade ku misoro n’amahoro, kimwe n’iby’abakora muri izo za ambasade no muri iyo miryango;
3) Igitabo cy’amashakiro y’ibinyabiziga by’ubutegetsi bwa Leta, iby’imishinga ya Leta n’iby’ibigo bya Leta byigenga n’ibigengwa na Leta;
4) Igitabo cy’amashakiro y’ibinyabiziga by’ingabo z’Igihugu;
5) Igitabo cy’amashakiro y’ibinyabiziga bya porisi y’igihugu;
6) Igitabo cy’amashakiro y’ibinyabiziga byinjijwe mu gihugu by’agateganyo.
2. Imikoreshereze y’igitabo cy’amashakiro y’ibinyabiziga by’abikorera ku giti cyabo, icy’ibinyabiziga byinjijwe mu gihugu by’agateganyo n’icy’ibinyabiziga bya za ambasade n’imiryango ifite ubusonerwe bishinzwe ibiro by’imisoro.
Imikoreshereze ya buri gitabo mu bindi bitabo by’amashakiro bishinzwe umutegetsi cyangwa abategetsi bashyirwaho ku buryo bwihariye na Perezida wa Repuburika.

A. Iyandikwa ry’ibinyabiziga by’abantu bikorera ku giti cyabo cyangwa ibya za ambasade cyangwa imiryango ifite ubusonerwe nk’ubwa za ambasade no ku bakozi b’izo za ambasade n’iyo miryango risabwa ibiro by’imisoro. Iryo sabwa riherekezwa nibi bikurikira:
1. Iyo ari ikinyabiziga gishya: icyemezo cy’uwagikoze cyangwa cy’uwungirije, cyemeza ko ikinyabiziga cyatanzwe ari gishya kandi kikerekana:
a. Ingeri y’ikinyabiziga;
b. Ikimenyetso cyangwa izina ry’uwakoze ikinyabiziga;
c. Ubwoko bwacyo;
d. Inomero yo shasi y’ikinyabiziga;
e. Inomero ya moteri y’ikinyabiziga;
f. Ingufu za moteri;
g. Uburemere bw’ikinyabiziga igihe gifite ibyangombwa byacyo byose;
h. Uburemere ntarengwa bwemewe bw’ikinyabiziga;
i. Umubare ntarengwa w’abagenzi;
j. Umwaka ikinyabiziga cyakorewemo.
2. Iyo ari ikinyabiziga gishaje:
a) Niba ikinyabiziga cyari cyarandikishijwe mu Rwanda iryo saba riherekezwa n’ikarita iranga ikinyabiziga yatanzwe mu gihe ikinyabiziga giherutse kwandikwa;
b) Niba ikinyabiziga kitarandikishwa mu Rwanda, iryo saba riherekezwa n’inyandiko igaragaza ibinyabiziga byavuzwe mu gika cya mbere cy’iyi nteruro.
3. Ukurikije uko ikinyabiziga kimeze, isaba riherekezwa n’inyandukuro y’icyemezo kivuga ko icyo kinyabiziga gitangiye gukora cyangwa cyaje kitazatinda.
B. Ibinyabiziga by’ubutegetsi n’ibigo byigenga kimwe n’ibinyabiziga by’Ingabo z’Igihugu bihabwa inomero n’ubutegetsi bubigenga kandi bakamenyesha ibiro by’imisoro ibiranga ibyo binyabiziga kimwe n’ibimenyetso byahawe.

1. Izina, izina ry’ingereka n’igicumbi bya nyirayo bigomba kwandikwa ku buryo bugaragara imbere kandi ku ruhande rw’ibimoso h’ikinyabiziga bikurikira:
a. Ibinyabiziga bigendeshwa na moteri byikorera ibiro birenze 1.000 (> 1,000 kg) kandi bidatwara abantu gusa;
b. Ibinyabiziga bikururuka;
c. Ibinyabiziga bisunikwa n’abantu;
d. Ibinyamitende bidasorerwa.
2. Ikinyabiziga cyose gikoreshwa gusa mu mirimo y’ubucuruzi kigomba kwandikwaho, uretse ibyanditswe biteganyijwe mu gika cya 1 cy’iyi ngingo kandi ku buryo bugaragara, ahantu nyiracyo yandikiwe mu gitabo cy’ubucuruzi na numero ye nk’uko bitegekwa n’ingingo ya 19 y’itegeko ryo kuwa 23 Nutarama 1971 ryerekeye igitabo cy’ubucuruzi.
3. Ikinyabiziga cyose kigenewe gutwara abantu bariha kigomba kwandikwaho, ku buryo bugaragara, ku rugi rw’umuyobozi no ku nzugi z’aho abagenzi binjirira, umubare ntarengwa w’abagenzi bashobora kugendamo, uwo mubare ntushobora kujya hejuru y’uwo uwakoze ikinyabiziga yagennye.
Inyuguti n’imibarwa bigize inyandiko imaze kuvugwa bigomba kugira ubuhagarike buto ntarengwa bwa santimetero 4 (4 cm) naho imibyimba yabyo ikagira ubugari buto ntarengwa bwa milimetero 5 (5 mm).

1. Cyitwa ko kiri mu igeragezwa ikinyabiziga kigendeshwa mu muhanda n’abagikoze, abagiteranyije, abashyiraho kariseri, abakigurisha, abongera kukigurisha cyangwa abasannyi b’ibinyabiziga:
a) Bamaze kugiteranya cyangwa kugisana kugirango basuzume imikorere myiza y’ikinyabiziga;
b) Bacyerekana kugirango kigurishwe;
c) Kugirango ikinyabiziga gishyikirizwe umuguzi.
2. Ibinyabiziga bigeragezwa bishobora kugendeshwa mu nzira nyabagendwa bifite ibimenyetso bibiranga byakozwe na Minisitiri ushinzwe transporo. Ibyapa bigomba gushyirwa ku kinyabiziga ku buryo buteganyijwe n’ingingo ya 130. 1 na 2 y’iri teka.
3. Ukoresha ikinyabiziga agomba kugira igitabo cyandikwamo uko numero z’ibyapa by’igeragezwa bikurikirana. Numero igezweho y’icyapa cy’igeragezwa yandikwa buri munsi mu gitabo cyandikwamo n’abakora cyangwa Abacuruza ibinyabiziga hakurikijwe ingingo ya 4 y’iteka rya Minisitiri n° 11/07 Fin ryo kuwa 20 Ukuboza 1973 ryerekeye imisoro y’umutungo no ku nyandiko ihinnye y’igitabo cya buri munsi umuyobozi w’ikinyabiziga agomba kwerekana igihe abisabwe n’umuyobozi ubifitiye ububasha.

Igenzurwa ry’imiterere y’ibinyabiziga rishyirwaho n’umutwe wa III (ingingo 3 kugeza kuri 5) z’itegeko n° 34/1987 ryo kuwa 17 Nzeri 1987 ryerekeye imihanda n’uburyo bwo kuyigendamo rirebana n’inzego z’ibinyabiziga zikurikira: (Inzego z’ ibinyabiziga bigenzurwa ni izi zikurikira):
