❖ Ibinyabiziga bikoreshwa na moteri byigirwaho gutwara;
❖ Ibindi binyabiziga bikoreshwa na moteri.

Inshuro zisuzumwa ngombwa zizakurukira zigenwa mu buryo bukurikira:
